00:42:48.510 --> 00:42:50.670
yet that's not something
I'm showing a whole lot yet.

00:42:50.670 --> 00:42:53.291
- Well, it'd be like, and I'm
being totally honest, Gary,

00:42:53.291 --> 00:42:54.124
you know...

00:42:54.124 --> 00:42:56.130
Like, you know...

00:42:56.130 --> 00:42:58.830
See, you know...

00:42:59.700 --> 00:43:01.210
When I talk about Rock the Bells,

00:43:01.210 --> 00:43:03.890
see most of the time
when people talk about

00:43:03.890 --> 00:43:04.723
what they're doing,

00:43:04.723 --> 00:43:06.560
they're either like a fucking shill

00:43:06.560 --> 00:43:07.500
or they're just,

00:43:07.500 --> 00:43:08.860
they're promo-in,

00:43:08.860 --> 00:43:09.913
or they're selling.

00:43:11.100 --> 00:43:13.700
But you gotta remember, like,

00:43:13.700 --> 00:43:15.920
this business that I'm talking about

00:43:15.920 --> 00:43:18.550
is the same thing that
I did when I was nine

00:43:18.550 --> 00:43:20.650
and started writing when I was 12

00:43:20.650 --> 00:43:21.800
and I'm really in this.

00:43:21.800 --> 00:43:26.800
And so for me, it's like the
idea that I can build something

00:43:27.600 --> 00:43:29.810
