00:43:29.810 --> 00:43:31.950
will have the narrative of hip hop...

00:43:32.810 --> 00:43:33.643
- Documented.

00:43:33.643 --> 00:43:35.200
- Be right. Will be right.

00:43:35.200 --> 00:43:37.850
Two, three, four, 500 years from now.

00:43:37.850 --> 00:43:38.683
That's what I'm talking about.

00:43:38.683 --> 00:43:41.860
I'm not talking about just
making a bunch of money.

00:43:41.860 --> 00:43:42.700
I do other things.

00:43:42.700 --> 00:43:45.237
I can make money in a
lot of different ways.

00:43:45.237 --> 00:43:46.690
And I say that with humility.

00:43:46.690 --> 00:43:48.611
I can make money.
- But it's true.

00:43:48.611 --> 00:43:51.470
- It's not only about making money.

00:43:51.470 --> 00:43:55.623
It's about building something
that means something.

00:43:55.623 --> 00:44:00.550
- Let's stay on this topic,
because I wanna enjoy this.

00:44:00.550 --> 00:44:02.840
I wanna educate some kids.

00:44:02.840 --> 00:44:06.450
How underrated is MC Lyte? Tell 'em.

00:44:06.450 --> 00:44:08.020
- Oh my God.

00:44:08.020 --> 00:44:09.699
MC Lyte, well first of-

00:44:09.699 --> 00:44:10.532
