00:44:25.291 --> 00:44:26.189
(both laughing)

00:44:26.189 --> 00:44:29.230
You know.

00:44:29.230 --> 00:44:30.063
It was bugged out.

00:44:30.063 --> 00:44:31.059
It was like, I just-

00:44:31.059 --> 00:44:33.030
You know, it made me uncomfortable

00:44:33.030 --> 00:44:34.440
'cause she's so good.

00:44:34.440 --> 00:44:38.780
I ended up writing her
rhyme on "Self-destruction."

00:44:38.780 --> 00:44:40.450
We did a song, "Self-destruction."

