00:45:51.151 --> 00:45:52.742
It was like D, Heavy D.

00:45:52.742 --> 00:45:54.146
You walked down that
basement, you're like,

00:45:54.146 --> 00:45:54.979
"What the-?"

00:45:54.979 --> 00:45:58.890
It was like he took his basement
to a whole 'nother level.

00:45:58.890 --> 00:45:59.843
Oh my God.

00:45:59.843 --> 00:46:01.740
But Hev was a really good thing,

00:46:01.740 --> 00:46:05.280
but it was like, my man Hev,
and my man Flash Gordon,

00:46:05.280 --> 00:46:07.913
them two, I won't say nothing around them.

00:46:07.913 --> 00:46:09.620
