00:46:14.010 --> 00:46:15.250
(laughing)

00:46:15.250 --> 00:46:17.000
- What about Mobb Deep?

00:46:17.000 --> 00:46:21.296
- Yo, Prodigy, one of my
favorite MCs and Havoc.

00:46:21.296 --> 00:46:23.970
Mobb, unbelievable. You
know what I'm saying?

00:46:23.970 --> 00:46:24.803
- What did they-

00:46:24.803 --> 00:46:25.636
When they-

00:46:25.636 --> 00:46:28.550
- The T-shirt that Prodigy's
wearing in the "Quiet Storm,"

00:46:28.550 --> 00:46:30.980
I think it's the "Quiet
